IMU algorithm reference
-----------------------
The calibration, Mahony and tilt modules are an independent C99
re-implementation of the algorithms reached from app_main() in
MagicRobot_V0.1/embedded. They were written from the actual executed code
(not the comments); the accel-bias/Mahony inconsistency of that reference is
documented in docs/imu-calibration.md and deliberately not reproduced.

Original work
-------------
The snake game core, renderer, font, desktop simulator, firmware port and
documentation are original work. Snake is a generic game genre; this project
contains no third-party characters, sprites or music.